      "text": "<table border=\"1\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>q</td>\t\t\t<td>w</td>\t\t\t<td><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>250 J</td>\t\t\t<td>- 460 J</td>\t\t\t<td>- 210 J</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table>",
